# --- Game data: NEVER commit ------------------------------------------------
# This project is developed against a Nintendo 64 cartridge dump that is
# Blizzard's and Nintendo's copyright. No ROM, ROM fragment, or extracted
# asset may ever enter this repository. The patterns below are deliberately
# broad; if you are tempted to add an exception, don't.
*.n64
*.z64
*.v64
*.rom
*.bin
*.smc
*.gba
*.iso
*.cdi
*.gdi
gamedata/
roms/
testdata/

